  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantAccountingPoliciesFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（重要な会計方針）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;１．資産の評価基準及び評価方法&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 12px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 636px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
